      "[Urban North Macedonia](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1A__irZqoXUD6zl2OUcO56odA9suAdQbUnICYf0PqSiM/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.62x9f0ucxtz9) by Tatert0t\n"
